OL,3,GNEWSAUnited Utilities fined #900k over
OL,4,Asewage discharges
OL,5,
OL,6,FA water company has been fined #900,000
OL,7,Ffor a sewage leak which led to swimming
OL,8,Fbeing banned on a stretch of coastline.
OL,10,FUnited Utilities (UU) Water Ltd
OL,11,Fadmitted five offences over the major
OL,12,Fpollution incident on Lancashire's
OL,13,FFylde coastline in June 2023.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
