OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1788895542
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAUnited Utilities fined #900k over
OL,4,Asewage discharges
OL,5,
OL,6,FPreston Magistrates' Court heard a pipe
OL,7,Fcollapse at Fleetwood Wastewater
OL,8,FTreatment Works led to raw sewage being
OL,9,Fdischarged into the Irish Sea for more
OL,10,Fthan 35 hours. The Environment Agency
OL,11,F(EA) said it was an "unacceptable
OL,12,Fpollution incident which had
OL,13,Ffar-reaching consequences for residents
OL,14,Fand businesses".
OL,16,FUU said it had immediately accepted
OL,17,Fresponsibility, apologised unreservedly
OL,18,Fand had taken steps to fix the problems
OL,19,Fas soon as possible.
